---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Support the Research"
  description="Support this 501(c)(3) (EIN 42-3220323). Gifts fund mechanobiology research and open publication, not a clinical service."
>
  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Support the Research</h1>

      <div class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-100 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 mb-10">
        <p class="text-slate-800 leading-relaxed mb-2">
          <strong>Rex Autistikon Research Foundation, Inc.</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-2">
          501(c)(3) public charity · 509(a)(2) · EIN 42-3220323
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Registered with the Florida Department of Agriculture and Consumer Services
          under the Solicitation of Contributions Act (Registration # CH84474,
          expiration 28 July 2027, DTN 4288286). Fee-exempt under s. 496.406 because
          the organization met the small-revenue, volunteer, and no-professional-solicitor
          criteria at the time of registration. Annual registration is still required.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <a
            href="/501c3-determination-letter.pdf"
            class="text-teal-700 font-medium hover:text-teal-800"
          >IRS determination letter (PDF)</a>
          ·
          <a href="/transparency" class="text-teal-700 font-medium hover:text-teal-800">Transparency</a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Gifts fund computational work, experimental collaboration, and open publication.
          They do not fund a clinical service. The Foundation is not a clinic and does not
          offer diagnosis or treatment. No causal claim about autism.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Contributions are tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-6 sm:gap-8">
          <a
            id="cta-donate"
            href="https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/donation-form/invest-in-the-future-of-neurodivergent-research"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            data-analytics-event="donate_click"
            class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-teal-700 text-white text-lg font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-teal-800 transition-colors"
          >
            Donate via Zeffy
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/donation-form/invest-in-the-future-of-neurodivergent-research"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            data-analytics-event="donate_click"
            class="inline-flex flex-col items-center gap-2 w-fit"
          >
            <img
              src="/zeffy-qr.svg"
              width="220"
              height="220"
              alt="QR code for the Zeffy donation form"
              class="w-[220px] max-w-full h-auto bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md"
            />
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-600">Scan to donate on Zeffy</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-4">
          Checkout is on Zeffy’s domain. The Foundation does not store full card numbers.
        </p>
        <aside class="mt-4 border border-slate-300 bg-white rounded-lg p-4" aria-label="Florida solicitation disclosure">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
            A COPY OF THE OFFICIAL REGISTRATION AND FINANCIAL INFORMATION MAY BE OBTAINED FROM THE DIVISION OF CONSUMER SERVICES BY CALLING TOLL-FREE WITHIN THE STATE AT <a href="tel:+18004357352" class="underline">1-800-HELP-FLA (435-7352)</a> OR VIA THE INTERNET AT <a href="https://www.fdacs.gov" class="underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WWW.FDACS.GOV</a>. REGISTRATION DOES NOT IMPLY ENDORSEMENT, APPROVAL, OR RECOMMENDATION BY THE STATE.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-800 mt-2">
            Florida registration number: CH84474.
          </p>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Rex Autistikōn Labs is an independent research initiative. All primary theoretical work is published openly. Your support helps fund computational modeling, experimental collaboration, and the continued development of the interactive biotensegrity model.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Other Ways to Help</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg text-slate-600 space-y-3 mb-10">
        <li>Share our open-access publications and research updates</li>
        <li>Collaborate on experimental validation (shear-wave elastography, interoceptive markers)</li>
        <li>Contribute domain expertise in biomechanics, fascia research, or computational modeling</li>
        <li>Help connect us with research groups or clinical partners interested in mechanism-based approaches</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6">
        We are committed to transparent use of funds in service of open, rigorous research.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
